| pg_default | Default tablespace for normal objects. |
| pg_global | Shared cluster-wide catalogs. |
| temp_tablespaces | Where temporary objects and sort spill files are placed. |
| Schema | Logical namespace inside a database. |
| pg_catalog | System catalogs/functions. |
| information_schema | Standard SQL metadata views. |
| public | General-purpose schema; PostgreSQL 15+ changes default ownership/CREATE behavior. |

